1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:02,963
Publishing a funnel is only the start.

2
00:00:02,963 --> 00:00:06,528
In this lesson, you'll learn
to read your funnel stats,

3
00:00:06,528 --> 00:00:09,510
run an A/B test to find
out what works better,

4
00:00:09,510 --> 00:00:12,427
and set up SEO so people
can find your pages.

5
00:00:13,362 --> 00:00:15,922
Open your funnel and click Stats.

6
00:00:15,922 --> 00:00:22,050
Across the top are the headline numbers:
how many people viewed the first page,

7
00:00:22,050 --> 00:00:25,153
how many opted in, and your opt-in rate.

8
00:00:25,153 --> 00:00:28,256
Here, 4,820 views turned into 412 leads.

9
00:00:29,111 --> 00:00:31,652
The table breaks this down step by step.

10
00:00:31,652 --> 00:00:33,113
All counts every visit.

11
00:00:33,113 --> 00:00:37,434
Uniques counts each person once,
even if they came back three times.

12
00:00:37,434 --> 00:00:41,245
Uniques is the truer picture
of how many people you reached.

13
00:00:42,096 --> 00:00:44,052
Now look for the biggest drop.

14
00:00:44,052 --> 00:00:47,963
Of the people who reached the
booking page, only 43% booked.

15
00:00:47,963 --> 00:00:53,048
That's the step to work on first, because
small gains there turn straight into

16
00:00:53,048 --> 00:00:53,895
appointments.

17
00:00:53,895 --> 00:00:56,373
Use the date range to compare periods.

18
00:00:57,222 --> 00:01:00,100
Instead of guessing
what to change, test it.

19
00:01:00,100 --> 00:01:04,941
Go to Steps, open the step you want
to improve, and click Create A/B Test.

20
00:01:04,941 --> 00:01:08,080
Kyntlo makes Variation B
as a copy of your page.

21
00:01:08,931 --> 00:01:14,010
Edit Variation B and change just one thing,
so you know what made the difference.

22
00:01:14,010 --> 00:01:16,456
The headline is a great place to start.

23
00:01:16,456 --> 00:01:17,773
Save, then head back.

24
00:01:19,349 --> 00:01:21,070
Both versions are now live.

25
00:01:21,070 --> 00:01:24,257
Visitors are split between
them, 50/50 by default.

26
00:01:24,257 --> 00:01:29,548
Use the slider if you'd rather send less
traffic to the new version while you build

27
00:01:29,548 --> 00:01:30,249
confidence.

28
00:01:31,099 --> 00:01:36,441
Here's a test Bloom has been running
for three weeks on the whitening offer.

29
00:01:36,441 --> 00:01:39,885
Variation B converts at
9.5%, against 6.8% for A.

30
00:01:39,885 --> 00:01:44,523
With over a thousand visitors each,
that's a result you can trust.

31
00:01:45,373 --> 00:01:48,741
So go to Steps and click
Declare Winner on Variation B.

32
00:01:48,741 --> 00:01:53,273
All traffic now goes to the better
page, and you can start your next test.

33
00:01:54,123 --> 00:01:54,660
Now SEO.

34
00:01:54,660 --> 00:01:58,347
In the page builder, open
Settings, then SEO Meta Data.

35
00:01:58,347 --> 00:02:02,772
The title and description are what
Google shows in search results,

36
00:02:02,772 --> 00:02:05,923
and what appears when
someone shares your link.

37
00:02:06,773 --> 00:02:12,163
Keep the title under 60 characters, with
the service and the location people search

38
00:02:12,163 --> 00:02:12,422
for.

39
00:02:12,422 --> 00:02:14,500
The preview updates as you type.

40
00:02:14,500 --> 00:02:17,812
Add a social image too, so
shared links look great.

41
00:02:20,300 --> 00:02:25,152
Finally, to measure your ads, paste your
Meta Pixel or Google tag into the head

42
00:02:25,152 --> 00:02:27,547
tracking code in the funnel's Settings.

43
00:02:27,547 --> 00:02:29,942
It's added to every step automatically.

44
00:02:30,793 --> 00:02:31,896
Here's a pro tip.

45
00:02:31,896 --> 00:02:36,826
Test one change at a time, and wait
until each version has had a few hundred

46
00:02:36,826 --> 00:02:38,578
visitors before you decide.

47
00:02:38,578 --> 00:02:40,329
Small samples can fool you.

48
00:02:41,180 --> 00:02:44,191
Now you can measure and
improve every funnel.

49
00:02:44,191 --> 00:02:49,813
Next, we'll publish blog posts and create
QR codes to bring offline visitors online.

50
00:02:49,813 --> 00:02:50,750
See you there.
